{"ID":"20240206135641-rsyt38b","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206135641-rsyt38b","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135641-rsyt38b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135653-tcv3udg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221115648-1ahgxkg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221115648-1ahgxkg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":" 金礞石","type":"doc","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135653-tcv3udg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135653-tcv3udg","updated":"20240206135657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产山东、江苏、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t鳞片状集合体。呈不规则块状或碎片，碎片直径、块状者直径210cm，厚0.61.5cm，无明显棱角。棕黄色或黄褐色，带有金黄色或银白色光泽。质脆，用手捻之，易碎成金黄色闪光小片。具滑腻感。气徽，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，平。\n【功效】\t坠痰下气，平肝镇惊。用于顽痰胶结，咳逆喘急，癫痫发狂，烦躁胸闷惊风抽搐。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135646-gqmasng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135646-gqmasng","updated":"20240206135646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135646-hnew1ld.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221115548-04gyfzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221115548-04gyfzg","updated":"20240708173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221115548-ln4yo66.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 557px;","style":"width: 547px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708173758-0ps3hsc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 547px;\" parent-style=\"width: 557px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708173816-y1a4z1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708173816-y1a4z1h","updated":"20240708173816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 484px;","style":"width: 474px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金礞石5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金礞石5-20240708173641-ukqhnk1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 474px;\" parent-style=\"width: 484px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221115606-rtl4mci.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708171909-jr9ggio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708171909-jr9ggio","updated":"20240830101227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 561px;","style":"width: 551px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221115648-j2yikc0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 551px;\" parent-style=\"width: 561px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830101231-t9vfxef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101231-t9vfxef","updated":"20240830101231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 319px;","style":"width: 309px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金礞石1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金礞石1-20240708172248-3d2eyjw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 309px;\" parent-style=\"width: 319px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 251px;","style":"width: 241px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金礞石20240708_173033"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金礞石20240708_173033-20240708173050-0juj5v3.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 241px;\" parent-style=\"width: 251px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708171741-ojv5ioa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240708171741-ojv5ioa"}},{"ID":"20240830102314-fwxuu58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-fwxuu58","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：金礞石"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-vz7oamv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-vz7oamv","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金礞石《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-03o3z7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-03o3z7b","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīnMénɡShí"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-ob27m91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-ob27m91","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】LAPISMICAEAUREUS"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-if50i64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-if50i64","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】礞石"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-hi9gku4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-hi9gku4","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为变质岩类蛭石片岩或水黑云母片岩。采挖后，除去杂石及泥沙。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-95ues63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-95ues63","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为鳞片状集合体。呈不规则块状或碎片，碎片直径0.1～0.8cm；块状者直径2～10cm,厚0.6～1.5cm，无明显棱角。棕黄色或黄褐色，带有金黄色或银白色光泽。质脆，用手捻之，易碎成金黄色闪光小片。具滑腻感。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-z260i61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-z260i61","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】取本品碎片少量，置铁片上加热，即层裂或散裂，膨胀2～5倍，有的鳞片变成弯曲的蛭虫状；色泽变浅，重量减轻，可浮于水面。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-xoogh5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-xoogh5o","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-fih5lnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-fih5lnr","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金礞石：除去杂石。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-bpihxhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-bpihxhf","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煅金礞石：取净金礞石，照明煅法（附录ⅡD）煅至红透。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-5xxkwsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-5xxkwsw","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、咸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-htcieva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-htcieva","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-48wuuje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-48wuuje","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】坠痰下气，平肝镇惊。用于顽痰胶结，咳逆喘急，癫痫发狂，烦躁胸闷，惊风抽搐。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-r606741","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-r606741","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～6g,多入丸散服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-lgb08no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-lgb08no","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-qvqbgea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-qvqbgea","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-ww5hfek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-ww5hfek","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金礞石《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-nanq12c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-nanq12c","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】金礞石一名，古文献未见记载，因其功效与青礞石基本相似，故常混用，统称为礞石，但经考古代所载的礞石均指青礞石(见\"青礞石\"条)，现将\"呈黄色和带有金黄色者称为“金礞石”，以示区别。据北京医学院药学系1958年分析，金礞石含大量Fe3+、Fe2+、Al3+、Mn2+及少量Mg2+和SiO23-，表明金礞石为富含Fe和Al的硅酸盐，而不同于青礞石，故《中华人民共和国药典》、《中药志》等现代中药着作已将两"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-y96xhqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-y96xhqn","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīnMénɡShí"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-p69zuwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-p69zuwn","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】LapisMicaeAureus"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-kpo1rzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-kpo1rzb","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】烂石、酥酥石"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-yrdyr23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-yrdyr23","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-64xs5ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-64xs5ql","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为变质岩类云母片岩的风化物蛭石片岩或水黑云母片岩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-wqkyqig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-wqkyqig","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：VermiculiteSchist；HydrobiotiteSchist"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-ixfofti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-ixfofti","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年可采，挖出后去掉杂石，除净泥土即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-tcf7j11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-tcf7j11","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-fthmz2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-fthmz2r","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.蛭石片岩主要由鳞片状矿物蛭石组成，次要矿物为水黑云母，含有少量普通角闪石、石英。鳞片细小，断面可见到层状，显微镜下薄片具明显定向排列。为鳞片变晶结构；片状构造。片岩颜色较淡，呈淡棕色或棕黄色。金黄色光泽。质较软，易碎，碎片主呈小鳞片状。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-fef80nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-fef80nt","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.为鳞片变晶结构；片状构造。片岩颜色较深，呈黄褐色或深铁黄色。金黄色或银白色光泽。体轻，质软，易碎，碎后如麦麸。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-zomjzzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-zomjzzo","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】分布于河南、陕西、山西、河北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-xxmyc0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-xxmyc0k","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-qbh4b14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-qbh4b14","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别(1)蛭石片岩主为鳞片状矿物组成的集合体。多数呈不规则碎片状或粒状，直径0.1-0.8cm。有的呈不规则扁块状或厚板状，长2-10cm，宽2-5cm，厚0.6-1.5cm。无棱角，断面可见层状。淡棕色或棕黄色；金黄色光泽。质较软，可在硬纸上书写，并留下淡棕色划痕。具土腥气，味淡。(2)水黑云母片岩：均为小鳞片组成的不规则块状、黄褐色或深铁黄色。金黄色或银白色光泽。均以块整、色金黄、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-5t3qi62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-5t3qi62","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别透射偏光镜下观察：主为蛭石、水黑云母及少量普通角闪石、石英。(1)蛭石：薄片中从无色至浅褐黄色。片状，依一定方向排列。低正突起；具多色性，Ng=Nm为浅褐色，Np无色；Ng=Nm\u003eNp；解理完全。干涉色达到Ⅲ级黄；近于平行消光；正延长符号。二轴晶；负光性。(2)水黑云母：薄片中颜色较深，浅黄褐色至黄褐色，多色性较强。(3)普通角闪石薄片中呈绿色；局部分布；多色性较强，Ng深绿色，Nm深绿色或绿色，Ng≥Nm\u003eNp；高正突起，糙面明显；一组解理，横切面两组解理，相交成56°与124°解理角。最高干涉色可达到Ⅱ级红；倾斜消光，消光角(C∧Ng)为12°-24°；正延长符号。二轴晶；负光性。(4)石英薄片中无色透明，分布于蛭石与水黑云母之间。低正突起，表面光滑，无糙面现象，见不到解理。最高干涉色为Ⅰ级黄白色。波状消光。一轴晶。正光性。折光率：No=1，544，Ne=1.533。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-ny29ccs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-ny29ccs","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3．理化鉴别(1)取金礞石碎片1-2片，置灼热铁片上，即层裂或散裂，迅速膨胀5-6倍，如小碎块即散裂，鳞片变为弯弯曲曲似蛭虫状；光泽变淡，呈银白色或浅黄色；体重显着减轻，可浮于水面。水黑云母片岩加热后膨胀较小，仅2-3倍。(2)红外光谱定性分析：蛭石IRλKBν/maxcm-1：3380，995，675，445；水黑云母：IRλKBr/maxcm-1：3690，3420，1010，680，520，460。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-l9gtinf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-l9gtinf","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】金礞石主要含钾、镁、铝的硅酸盐[K(Mg，Fe)2(AlSi5O10)(OH，F)2]，亦可含钒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-x2nqk8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-x2nqk8b","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】取本品碎片少量，置铁片上加热，即层裂或散裂，膨胀2-5倍，有的鳞片变成弯曲的蛭虫状；色泽变浅，重量减轻，可浮于水面。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-atv7t96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-atv7t96","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-oba47rz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-oba47rz","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参见“青礞石”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-soq7dfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-soq7dfp","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饮片性状：金礞石为不规则块状或粉末，棕黄色，带有耀眼的金黄色光泽，质脆，易碎，气微，味淡。煅金礞石为粉末状，黄褐色，闪金星更明显，无臭，无味。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-w1dhvj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-w1dhvj2","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮干燥容器内，置干燥处，防尘。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-g43czj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-g43czj7","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；咸；平"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-26mgdzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-26mgdzg","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；心；肝；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-dvwwjxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-dvwwjxu","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】坠痰下气；平肝镇惊；消食攻积。主顽痰咳喘；癫痫发狂；烦躁胸闷；惊风抽搐；宿食症瘕"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-wwayzf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-wwayzf7","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：入丸、散，3-6g；煎汤，10-15g，布包。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-6j56fh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-6j56fh3","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】虚弱之人及孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-a8x5q4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-a8x5q4f","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.礞石滚痰丸：金礞石(煅)40g，沉香20g，黄芩320g，熟大黄320g。以上四味，粉碎成细粉，过筛，混匀。用水泛丸，干燥，即得。本品为黄色至棕褐色的水丸；味苦。显微特征：草酸钙簇晶大，直径60-140μm。纤维管胞壁略厚，有具缘纹孔，纹孔口人字形或十字形。纤维淡黄色，梭形，壁厚，孔沟细。类长方形或不规则块片淡黄棕色。功能降火逐痰。用于实热顽痰，发为癫痫惊悸，或咳喘痰稠，大便秘结。口服，每次6-12g，每日1次。孕妇忌服。(《中华人民共和国药典》1990年)2.礞石滚掇片：金礞石(煅)60g，沉香30g，黄芩甙22g，熟大黄100g，大黄流浸膏380ml。除大黄流浸膏外，其余四味粉碎成细粉，过筛，混匀，将大黄流浸膏浓缩至适量，与细粉混匀，制粒，干燥，压制成1000片。片重0.32g。本品为棕褐色片，味苦。显微特征：草酸钙簇晶大，直径60-140μm，纤维管胞壁略厚，有缘纹孔，纹孔口人字形或十字形，类长方形或不规则块片淡黄棕色；取本品研细，加水提取，滤过，取滤液加稀盐酸至pH1-2，离心，弃去溶液，沉淀加水，再加1mol/L氢氧化钠溶液至pH6-7，使溶解，照纸层析项下的径向纸色谱法试验，取上述溶液5-10μl，点于纸上，以正丁醇一醋酸一水(6：2：4)为展开剂，展开，晾干，置紫外灯下观察，近前沿为黄色荧光带，近中部为暗红色荧光带。功能降火逐痰，通便。用于顽痰壅塞，咳喘痰稠，大便秘结，精神分裂症，狂躁。口服，每次8片，每日1次。孕妇禁服。(《四川省药品标准》1983年)"}]},{"ID":"20240830102314-52409x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102314-52409x6","updated":"20240830102320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102315-on7alke","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830102315-on7alke","updated":"20240830102320"}},{"ID":"20240830102316-41e6m3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102316-41e6m3p","updated":"20240830102320"}}]}